        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b158519-JNJStowKzyTy.png"
        },
        "description": "Xunyu is a Master from the Huang He Empire. She is currently ranked 2nd in their duel rankings. She is also one of the Huang He Si Ling.\n\nDue to the effect of her Jiangshi job, Xunyu is an undead with skin so pale it appears blue and jagged teeth. She dresses in outfits similar to what those jiangshi wear in traditional Chinese literature, complete with a Voice Changing Fu that covers her face and changes her voice.\n\nShe is a young girl with a mischievous attitude, being fond of playing little tricks on people from time to time. However, she is quite friendly, managing to make several friends amongst the Masters of the Kingdom of Altar during her stay there.\n\n(Source: Infinite Dendrogram Wiki)",
